{
  "name" : "Precup2012 - Mathematical modeling of cell dynamics after allogeneic bone marrow transplantation",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a basic mathematical model describing the dynamics of three cell lines (normal host cells, leukemic host cells and donor cells) after allogeneic stem cell transplantation.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
